"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_positions>`__,"
" `long_pos "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_pos>`__,"
" and `short_pos "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_pos>`__."
" To check whether any long or short positions are open without "
"materializing them, use `has_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.has_long_positions>`__"
" and `has_short_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.has_short_positions>`__:"
msgstr ""
"使用 `positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.positions>`__、`long_positions"
" "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_positions>`__、`short_positions"
" "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_positions>`__、`long_pos"
" "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_pos>`__"
" 和 `short_pos "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_pos>`__。如果只是想检查是否存在多头或空头仓位，而不需要实际获取这些仓位对象，可以使用"
" `has_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.has_long_positions>`__"
" 和 `has_short_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.has_short_positions>`__："

